    "body": "@domenic I will add some tests in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1435596 so you should go ahead and merge this.  If you wanted to, you could land the test changes from that patch in wpt, I guess, instead of waiting for us to merge them back.\r\n\r\nI tried running those tests in Chrome, but Chrome seems to fail most of the tests in wpt's html/browsers/origin/cross-origin-objects/cross-origin-objects.html.... It _does_ pass the specific tests I added for Promise.resolve() with cross-origin objects, but not any of the tests about the actual internal methods, because it seems to be doing nothing even resembling what the spec says.  :(",
